@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AA8B8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceParticipantPadding 18
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
hide footbox
autonumber
title B 推文协作 · 黑盒系统序列

actor "外部来稿人" as D
actor "采编部长" as E
actor "运营部长" as M
actor "排版承接人" as W
actor "一审老师" as T1
actor "二审老师" as T2
participant ":青年传媒中心工作台" as S
D -> S : 提出推文任务(标题、期限、来源)\nUC-OL-001
activate S
S --> D : 任务编号、待提交源稿
deactivate S
D -> S : 提交源稿(任务、正文、材料)\nUC-OL-002
activate S
S --> D : 源稿版本、待内容审核
deactivate S
E -> S : 审核源稿(版本、通过)\nUC-OL-003
activate S
S --> E : 可以安排承接
deactivate S
M -> S : 安排承接(任务、干事)\nUC-OL-004
activate S
S --> M : 承接安排、干事待办
deactivate S
loop 排版版本尚未全部通过（初稿或退回重提）
W -> S : 提交排版(任务、正文、预览、材料)\nUC-OL-005
activate S
S --> W : 当前版本、待运营内审
deactivate S
M -> S : 确认内审(当前版本、结论)\nUC-OL-006
activate S
S --> M : 通过则待教师一审；退回则待修改
deactivate S
opt 运营内审通过
T1 -> S : 完成一审(当前版本、结论)\nUC-OL-007
activate S
S --> T1 : 通过则待二审；退回则待修改
deactivate S
opt 教师一审通过
T2 -> S : 完成二审(当前版本、结论)\nUC-OL-008
activate S
S --> T2 : 通过则待发布；退回则待修改
deactivate S
end
end
end
M -> S : 登记发布(已全部通过的版本、公开地址)\nUC-OL-009
activate S
alt 版本、审核和权限均有效
S --> M : 发布结果、归档编号、合格内部贡献
else 条件失效或重复冲突
S --> M : 失败原因；不重复归档计时
end
deactivate S

@enduml
